To summarize each .txt file under notes/ in one short line, as `filename: summary`, you can use the `awk` tool.

 Here is the revised command: 

{"name": "bash", "parameters": {"command":"awk '{print $3 \":\" $1 }' notes/*.txt","workdir":"/private/var/folders/s5/pnld4xwd6m78ztb80vplzpjc0000gp/T/agentbench-qnwb8koh/ws"}}
